==Notes==
*Daggers benefit from the [[weapon finesse]] [[feat]].
*Daggers can be used by all [[base class]]es.
* Daggers and [[kukri]]s are the only standard [[light weapon]]s for the small races ([[gnome]] and [[halfling]]).

==Toolset==
* Daggers are listed under the [[bladed blueprint category]] of the [[item palette]] in the [[toolset]].